{
  "bookId": "hero-213108",
  "id": "bond-29335",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "29335001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "哇——好大的屋子，里面的家具好可爱……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29335002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "这真的是送给玛莉的吗？该让海莲娜大人也看一看。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29335003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "是的，毕竟你这些天帮了很多忙。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29335004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "哇，床垫好软，玛莉都想在上面蹦来蹦去了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29335005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "……那个，岛主不会说玛莉像小孩子吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29335006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "当然不会。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29335007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "就算是足够成熟的大人，也会需要时间去休闲放松的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29335008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "岛主……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29335009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "怎么了?",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29335010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "没什么，呵呵，再陪玛莉一会儿吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29335011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "可以哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29335012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "和玛莉一起放松以后，就去玩水吧……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29335013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "一起？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29335014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "呼哈……有点困了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29335015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29335016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……聊着聊着就睡着了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
